# Line endings are the repository's decision, not each machine's
# core.autocrlf. Everything Git detects as text is stored and checked out
# with LF on every platform; this repo has no Windows-native scripts that
# need CRLF. Binary types are listed explicitly so autodetection never
# touches them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.bin  binary
*.a    binary
*.lib  binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
